The work-stealing example (examples/work-stealing) on the machine's GPU, its
places GPU processes that share the GPU's teams. With and without stealing,
with one to four places, it gives the iterations and checksum of mandel.py, with
MANDEL_CENTRE set to the example's centre (work-stealing.test), on 64 pixels
square in tiles of 8 for 12 frames, and of mandel.c, so set, for the whole
zoom at 512 pixels in tiles of 32. No stack warning: its processes
fit the default stack.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

The program is built afresh: the Makefile rebuilds it only when its source
changes, not merkc or the runtime, and %t outlives a run.
RUN: rm -rf %t
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 make -s -C %S/../../examples run-work-stealing MERKC=merkc BUILD=%t ARCH=%offload-arch "LIBOMP_FLAGS=%libomp-flags" 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=STEAL4,SMALL,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 make -s -C %S/../../examples run-work-stealing-no-steal MERKC=merkc BUILD=%t ARCH=%offload-arch "LIBOMP_FLAGS=%libomp-flags" 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=STATIC4,SMALL,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=1 %t/work_stealing 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=SMALL,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=2 %t/work_stealing 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=SMALL,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=3 %t/work_stealing 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=SMALL,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=512 MANDEL_TILE=32 %t/work_stealing 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=ZOOM,QUIET
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=512 MANDEL_TILE=32 %t/work_stealing no-steal 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=ZOOM,QUIET

QUIET-NOT: {{[Ww]arning|stack}}
STEAL4: Work stealing: 4 places, stealing on
STATIC4: Work stealing: 4 places, stealing off
SMALL: Iterations: 1569945
SMALL-NEXT: Checksum: 7844946
STATIC4-NEXT: Steals: 0
STATIC4-NEXT: Place 0: 192 tiles, 0 steals
STATIC4-NEXT: Place 1: 192 tiles, 0 steals
STATIC4-NEXT: Place 2: 192 tiles, 0 steals
STATIC4-NEXT: Place 3: 192 tiles, 0 steals
ZOOM: Iterations: 7586687417
ZOOM-NEXT: Checksum: 231769596101
